      "text": "Search this site Embedded Files Gilson Lab Gilson Lab Pre-pandemic group, former lab members, significant others, and potential future lab members. We use theoretical, computational, informatic, and experimental approaches to evaluate and advance the methods of computer-aided drug design. We also work on drug discovery projects and study molecular motors and other nonequilibrium systems. Quick Links BindingDB Center for Drug Discovery Innovation Drug Design Data Resource (D3R) Open Force Field Initiative Lab Publications UCSD Skaggs School of Pharmacy and Pharmaceutical Sciences Michael K. Gilson Mike Gilson, MD, PhD, is Professor and Chair in Computer-Aided Drug Design at the Skaggs School of Pharmacy and Pharmaceutical Sciences and co-director of UC San Diego' s Center for Drug Discovery Innovation . Report abuse Report abuse",
